# code: Neovim on the left, an agent on the top right, and lazygit on the bottom right.
#
# Each line is one pane: NAME FROM DIRECTION SIZE COMMAND
#   FROM       the pane to split. The first line has "-", because it is the first pane.
#   DIRECTION  right or down.
#   SIZE       the part of the FROM pane that stays with FROM, from 0.1 to 0.9.
#   COMMAND    the program to start, or "-" for a plain shell.
editor  -       -      -     nvim .
agent   editor  right  0.55  -
git     agent   down   0.45  lazygit
